<title>SPAIN: Spain Sept currency reserves rose $1.276 bln.</title>
<headline>Spain Sept currency reserves rose $1.276 bln.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain gave the following provisional figures (millions of dollars):</p>
<p> RESERVES		     SEPT 96     AUG 96	SEPT 95</p>
<p> Rise/fall in month	 1,276.4	420.5	  338.4</p>
<p> End-month total	   56,399.9   55,123.5     37,642.5</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
